# The rows of src/runtime/recipes/vulpen/library/parts/deck/Deck.cpp, a call each (src/tools/bench/bench.py).

## Deck.cpp/Deck::bind
typed connected -> ["input area", "output tabs", "output p1", "output p2", "output p3", "input typed"]
typed not -> ["input area", "output tabs", "output p1", "output p2", "output p3"]

## Deck.cpp/Deck::cook
holds with empty names -> sent []; tabs p2 > view switch p2, current, close v: param set d holds p1; p1 > view switch p1, close v: param set d holds p2; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
it holds none -> sent []; tabs perform, current; rects p1 0x0 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
it holds p1 and p3, p3 not hosted -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, current, close v: param set d holds p3; rects p1 100x100 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
it holds p2 only -> sent []; tabs p2 > view switch p2, current, close v: param unset d holds; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
none presented, shown unset -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, current, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 100x100 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
p1 and p2 held, none hosted -> sent []; tabs perform, current; rects p1 0x0 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
p2 presented -> sent ["v: param set d shown p2"]; tabs p1 > view switch p1, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, current, role 10, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
p2 presented, shown p2 -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, current, role 10, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
p3 presented, which it does not hold -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, current, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 100x100 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
shown p2 -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, current, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
shown p3, which it does not hold -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, current, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 100x100 p2 0x0 p3 0x0

## Deck.cpp/Deck::cook, frame after frame
none presented -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, current, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 100x100 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
p1 and p2 hosted -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, current, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 100x100 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
p1 hosted again, after p2 -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, current, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 100x100 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
p1 no longer hosted -> sent []; tabs p2 > view switch p2, current, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
p2 presented -> sent ["v: param set d shown p2"]; tabs p1 > view switch p1, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, current, role 10, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
the same again, the tabs written to since -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, current, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, close v: param set d holds p1; kept; rects p1 100x100 p2 0x0 p3 0x0

## Deck.cpp/Deck::refocus
focus on a, p2 presented -> sent ["v: focus c", "v: param set d shown p2"]; tabs p1 > view switch p1, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, current, role 10, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
focus on b, p2 presented -> sent ["v: param set d shown p2"]; tabs p1 > view switch p1, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, current, role 10, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
focus on d, p2 presented -> sent ["v: focus c", "v: param set d shown p2"]; tabs p1 > view switch p1, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, current, role 10, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
focus on x, p2 presented -> sent ["v: param set d shown p2"]; tabs p1 > view switch p1, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, current, role 10, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0
no keys connected, p2 presented -> sent ["v: param set d shown p2"]; tabs p1 > view switch p1, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, current, role 10, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 0x0 p2 100x100 p3 0x0

## Deck.cpp/Deck::take_focus
a press past its area -> sent []; tabs perform, current; rects p1 0x0 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
in focus, a press in its area -> sent []; tabs perform, current; rects p1 0x0 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
in focus, escape -> sent ["v: focus"]; tabs perform, current; rects p1 0x0 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
showing none, a press in its area -> sent ["v: focus d"]; tabs perform, current; rects p1 0x0 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
showing p1, a press in its area -> sent []; tabs p1 > view switch p1, current, close v: param set d holds p2; p2 > view switch p2, close v: param set d holds p1; rects p1 100x100 p2 0x0 p3 0x0
